* text eol=lf
# Denote all files that are truly binary and should not be modified.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.icns binary
*.gif binary
# Fonts are binary; without this, `* text eol=lf` mangles any woff2/ttf
# that happens to contain 0D 0A byte pairs (corrupts the font on commit).
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
